<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2 MKLNT-OMU SEBEZI NO KUTOLOKA EBIBELE NO SILUYANA</book>
  <para style="h">2 MAKOLINTE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eliñolo no wiili lya Paulusi ku Makolinte</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Makolinte</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 CO</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi no wiili ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAKOLINTE</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Elin̄olo no wiili no Makolinte kama linakun̄oliwa kwa Mutumiwa Paulusi mu naka no kukwana makumi mutanu ni mutanu okutwala ku makumi mutanu ni mutanu ni kamweya munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite (1.1). Eli elin̄olo no wili ku man̄olo ayiili awo tuli nawo ana kun̄oliwa kwa Paulusi ku Keleke mu Kolinte. Asiku kwiyeta kama alumela nji Paulusi na kun̄ola aman̄olo no kupula ku Makolinte. Kono katukwite simba limweya kuman̄olo ao abapanya Kauhanyo no 2.3-4. Elin̄olo no wiili (2 Makolinte) kamali kulubelwa nji kamalina kun̄oliwa abo Paulusi yoli mu Mesidoniya (2.13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Makolinte no wiili ni lya utokwa onene mi kame lyamba eyaye luli. Paulusi kame awabelelwe mulibaka no lin̄usano kuwaba ana kutambula okutunda kwa Tite ulibaka no keleke ili mu Kolinte. Mu lin̄olo eli, kame tuwanamo outungi no tuto mulibaka no mu kumona no ulikani no ubya, musibaka omo Paulusi aba etitaelo mu kuwaneka amali aoa afanena okutwaliwa mukutusa asi kupumena mu Jelusalema (8-9). Kame kumonahala nji atuiwa anjili no mapwa okutunad kundee no keleke kame akutusisa etikezo no anu anjili mu keleke okulwisa Paulusi okubeka beulu. Kama ana kulwanga esepo beulu no maata a Paulusi, esi mwendi esina ku mulitela nji cwale mu maata aiyatetete etukelo yaye okutenda omutumiwa wa Jesu Kilesite aba musheeteta ku mamaneneno no Maklinte no wiili (2 Makolinte).</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no titaba</para>
  <para style="io">Paulusi kame atateka elin̄olo mu kukeeta ekeleke (1.1-7)</para>
  <para style="io1">Esisitatama ko Paulusi kame aamba okufutuka kwaye mu mileleo no myendo yaye ni lin̄usa ana kutambula mu libaka lyoo mane ni kalabo ku lin̄olo lyaye na kunyima (1.8-9;16).</para>
  <para style="io1">Munyima no eyi, Paulusi kame aba etitaelo mulibaka no kuwaneka amali no asikupumena mu Jelusalema (8.1-9;15).</para>
  <para style="io1">Ku mamaneneno, Paulusi kame aimanena outumiwa waye mane ni kuba etimamela mulibaka no poto yaye eyo ikeyile (10.1-13.10)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1"/>Okutunda kwa mene Paulusi ni Timoteya omwabetu, omutumiwa wa Kilesite Jesu mu kusinga kwa Nyambe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Kame ni n̄olela ekeleke ya Nyambe eyi ili mu kolinte, naanu a Nyambe onje no kukena aa ali mu naha yonje no Akaya. <verse eid="2CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2"/>Mu biwe esishemo ni kozo okutunda kwa Nyambe Sitetu, ni kwa Mbumu Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="2CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yo Kutumela kwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3"/>Nyambe a lumbekiwe, yonyene Sitaye Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite Sitange no makeke, Nyambe weyi no kombaomba konje! <verse eid="2CO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4"/>Woyo otombaomba mu tin̄alelwa tetu tonje, nji cwale naaci tufanene okuombaomba awo ali mu tin̄alelwa tonje, okombaombiwa oko kutunda kwa Nyambe tuna ombaombiwa naaci. <verse eid="2CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5"/>Kakuli kanyi aba tukutabela mu kupula mu mayando a Kilesite, cwale mwa Kilesite kame tukutabela mu kupula mukuombaombiwa kame. <verse eid="2CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6"/>Nji kame tuyandisiwa kame ni kuombaombiwa mane ni mukuyoyisiwa kwenu, mi nji kame tongotwa naanyi kame tuombaombiwa, okuombaombiwa oko mukwite aba mutwalelela mukuyanda oko tuyanda naaci. <verse eid="2CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7"/>Mi esepo yetu kwaanyi kame yongolile, me tuyii nji kanyi aba mu kutabela ku mayando etu, mba mukutabele ngeeso nimu okuombaombiwa kwetu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8"/>Kakuli abaange, katusingi nji mu ulwe okuyupa eyi no mayando awo ana kutwiyela mu Esiya. Kakuli kame tuna kwimelwa onene mane oku bita amaata etu mi sebeli tubwelwa ni sepo no kuyoya kame. <verse eid="2CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9"/>Iikene aba tuna kuyupa nji kame tuna atulelwe elifu, kono eyo neli okutu tenda nji tulese oukusepa twenyene kono nji tusepe Nyambe woyo oingula aafu. <verse eid="2CO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10"/>Kame ana tuyoyisa okutunda ku kozi no lifu, mi mbatu yoyisa, mi kame tuna beeke esepo yetu kwa yonyene nji cwale mbatuyoyisa kame, <verse eid="2CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11"/>naanyi ngeso mutu tuse okutu lapelela. Nji cwale ano kupula kame sakutumele mulibaka lyetu kakuli embuyoti tu tambula kame titunda mu tikalabo no titapelo no kupula.<verse eid="2CO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okusiuluka mu Milelo ya Paulusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12"/>Kakuli oukuyeema kwetu ninji oupaki no lizwalo lyetu owo tuna tende mu litunga mi isili onene kwaanyi ni kukena ni niti ya Nyambe, kasa okushangama no litunga kono nimu sishemo sa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13"/>Kakuli katu min̄olele eyambo indina, kono eyo mutwesa okubala niku yupisisa. Kame ni sepa nji mbamu yupisisa wino, <verse eid="2CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14"/>kanyi aba muna yupu mu lineku linjili, nji kame mutwesa oukuyeema mulibaka lyetu kanyi aci aba satu kuyeema mulibaka lyenu ba liywaa lya Mbumu Jesu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15"/>Kakuli kame nina kusepa esi, kame nina kusinga okwiiya kwaanyi oweli nji cwale mu fuyolwe twiili kweyi. <verse eid="2CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16"/>Kame nina saele nji ni mipotele aba nita ku Masedoniya mane ni kumyukela aba ni tunda ku Masedonia, nji cwale munitume okuta ku Judeya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17"/>Aba ni nakusinga okutenda esi kameni nakuikala ni micima iyili? Kana kame ni nakutenda emihupulo yange kanyi omunu feela no litunga? Woyo okutukisete okwamba “Ee” simba “kokuulwa” ba nako imweya?<verse eid="2CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18"/>Niti luli kanyi Nyambe aba ali woyo no kusepahala, eliywi no okwamba kwetu kwaanyi kasa nji “Ee” ni “Kokuulwa”. <verse eid="2CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19"/>Kakuli Omwana Nyambe, Jesu Kilesite, woyo tuna kukutaza mukaci kenu, Silubanasi, ni Timoteya ni Mene, kakusi tendiwa “Ee” ni “Kokuulwa”. Kono mwa yonyene mu nako yonje ni Ee. <verse eid="2CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20"/>Kakuli etisepiso tonje ta Nyambe kame tiwana Ee yato mwa yonyene. Mulibaka elyo kame twamba Ameni mwa yonyene ku kanya ya Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21"/>Kono neli Nyambe woyo otutenda okwimana mu kongola naanyi mwa Kelesite mi yokame ona kututuma, <verse eid="2CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22"/>na beeke enombolo yaye beulu yetu ni kutuba Emebo yaye mu micima yetu nji tukulemenenebo feela.<verse eid="2CO 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23"/>Kono kame ni isana Nyambe atende opaki, neli okumi sileleza aba nina kuulwa okwiiya ku Kolinte. <verse eid="2CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24"/>Kasanji kame tubusa etumelo yenu, kono kame tusebeza naanyi muku wabelelwa kwenu, kakuli kame muna ongola mu tumelo yenu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1"/>Kakuli kame nina puluka nji nilese okumi potela nji nilese okumiyupisa okukola kame. <verse eid="2CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2"/>Kakuli nji ni miyupise okukola, anyine soni wabelisa? Kono woyo nina yupisa okukola. <verse eid="2CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3"/>Kame nina n̄olo kanyi omo nina tendele nji cwale aba saniiye nuulwe okuyandisiwa kwaawo afanena okuni wabelisa. Kakuli kame ni sepile anyi monje nji okuwabelelwa kwange okuwabelelwa kwenu monje. <verse eid="2CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4"/>Kakuli kame ninaku mi n̄olela meni yanda niku ziyeleha omucima ni myooti no kupula, mi kasa okumi yupisa okukola kono okumi limukisa elilato nokuneneba elyo nili nalyo kwaanyi.<verse eid="2CO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okulemeniwa kwaa Sikufosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5"/>Nji omunjili kame ana yupisiwa okukola kasa mene ana yupisa okukola kono ni kwaanjili, kame naamba ngeso kakuli kanisingi nji esi sitende esi no kubambaba kwanyi. <verse eid="2CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6"/>Kakuli ku munu woyo onabiwi ekoto kwaanu no kupula nakubu. <verse eid="2CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7"/>Cwale ouwa niku mulemena ni ku muombaoamba kakuli mbafanene okwibaiwa ku kweena kwaye onene. <verse eid="2CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8"/>Cwale kame nimikumbela nji mongote elilato lyenu mwa yonyene. <verse eid="2CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9"/>Kakuli sokame eso nina min̄olele ngeso nji ni myeteke ni kulimuka nji kame mukuteka mu inu yonje. <verse eid="2CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10"/>Omunu yonje woyo samulemene nimene kame ni mulemena ngeso, eso nina lemene, nji kame nina lemene esinu sinjili ni mulibaka lyenu balubala lwa Kilesite, <verse eid="2CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11"/>okwapumena Satani nji awane esibaka beulu yetu, kakuli kasa nji katu limukile emilelo yaye.<verse eid="2CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epilaelo ya Paulusi mu Tulowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12"/>Aba nina kwiiya mu Tulowasi muku kutaza eliywi no kuwaba lya Kilesite, omweelo kame onaku yatulelwa mene mwa Mbumu. <verse eid="2CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13"/>Kono kanisi kupumula wino mu minahano yange kakuli kanisi kuwana mwabange Tite muya. Cwale sebeli nasiya okuta ku Mesodoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okukoma mwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14"/>Kono tuku tumele kwa Nyambe woyo mwa Kilesite enako yonje kame atutwaletela mu kukoma ni mwaaci kame alita omumwee no zibo yaye mu ibaka yonje <verse eid="2CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15"/>Kakuli kame tuli omumwee wa Kelesite no kumamata kwa Nyambe mukaci kaawo ayoyisiwa ni mukaci kaawo afa. <verse eid="2CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16"/>Kwa anjili kame tuli omwwee no kutunda ku lifu okuta ku lifu, kwaanjili kame tuli omumwee no kutunda ku moyo okuta ku moyo. Anyine woyo otwesa einu eyi? <verse eid="2CO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17"/>Kakuli katu kufekile naanjili no kupula awo aulisa eliywi lya Nyambe kono kanyi omo alume no niti kanyi omo atubela Nyambe, mu miyo a Nyambe kame tulyamba mwa Kilesite.<verse eid="2CO 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Abika no Ulikani no Ubya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1"/>Kame tutangisa oukuyeema twenyene kame? Simba kame tusinga kanyi omo atendela anjili, aman̄olo awo amipaka simba okutunda kwaanyi? <verse eid="2CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2"/>Anyi mwenyene elin̄olo lyetu elyo litupaka, elyo lin̄olilwe mu micima yenu nji lilimukiwe ni kubaliwa kwaanu onje, <verse eid="2CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3"/>mi kame mumonisa nji aanyi elin̄olo eli litunda kwa Kilesite tunatumu aci, elyo kalyasi n̄oliwa ni inki kono ni mebo ya Nyambe no kuyoya, kasa ba matapa no mawee kono ba matapa no micima no aanu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4"/>Yokame etumelo tuli nayo kwa Kilesite mulibaka lya Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5"/>Kasanji kame tutwesa okutenda esinu twenyene kanyi kame situnda kwaaci, okutwesa kwetu kame kutunda kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6"/>Yokame ona tutende nji tubekiwe abika no ulikani no ubya kasa ba taku ina n̄oliwa kono mu Mebo. Kakuli etaku in̄olilwe kame ibaa, kono Emebo kame ilita omoyo.<verse eid="2CO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7"/>Cwale nji esitulo no lifu eyi ina kun̄oliwa muku cakula ba liwee, aba ina kwiiya ni kanya no ngeso nji Amaisilaele kame ana ku kwangwa okwaliketa ba lubala lwa Mushe kakuli mulibaka no kubenya kwalo nakubu kanyi omo luna kwikalela, <verse eid="2CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8"/>kasa nji esitulo no Mebo kame sasibitelele onene ku kanya? <verse eid="2CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9"/>Kakuli nji kame kuna kwikala ekanya mu situlo no kunyaziwa, esitulo no kuluka kame saibitelele onene ku kanya. <verse eid="2CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10"/>Niti luli mu taba eyi eso sina kwikala ni kanya kame sasi ulwe ekanya mulibaka no kanya eyo iibitelela. <verse eid="2CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11"/>Kakuli esi sina kubwa aba sineyi ni kanya, onene esi si ulwa okubwa kame sasi ikale ni kanya no kuneneba ni kubitelela.<verse eid="2CO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12"/>Kakuli kame tuli ni sepo no ngeso, kame tuli ni maata. <verse eid="2CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13"/>Aci katukufekile kanyi Mushe, woyo ona ku kufuka olwambi ba lubala nji Amaisilaele alese kumona amamaneneno no kanya no kwamonahala wino. <verse eid="2CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14"/>Kono emihupulo yoo kame inakongola onene okulita ni balelo lino, aba abala eyi no ulikani no kale okwamona wino koo kusiliko kakuli konji Kelesite yotwesa okutundisa okwamona wino. <verse eid="2CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15"/>Ee ba liywaa lino simba nji omulawo wa Mushe kame obaliwa okwayupisisa kusiliko mu mihupulo yoo. <verse eid="2CO 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16"/>Kono omunu aba a siulukela kwa Mbumu okwamona wino mbaku tundisiwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17"/>Cwale Ombumu yo Mebo, mi aba kuli Emebo ya Mbumu kame kuli etukuluho. <verse eid="2CO 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18"/>Cwale aaci tonje tuli ni timala no kwafukiwa kame tumona ekanya ya Mbumu kame tufutukile mu sifekiso simweya ni yonyene, okutunda ku kanya okuta ku kanya injli kakuli kame itunda kwa Mbumu woyo oli Emebo.<verse eid="2CO 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Oufumu no Mebo mu Tucoo no Limaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1"/>Cwalehe, aba tuli ni situlo mu makeke a Nyambe, tulese okuzwafa. <verse eid="2CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2"/>Na tusiyi einu eyo yenisa eyo ishwekilwe, ka twende mu tingana no kwiiba simba okuwaneka eliywi lya Nyambe kono mu kumonahaza eniti kame tufanena oukubeeka twenyene elizwalo lya munu yonje mu miyo a Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3"/>Cwale simba nji eliywi no kuwaba lyetu nali shwekiwa, kame li shweekelwe awo afa. <verse eid="2CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4"/>Mu taba yoo onyambe no litunga lino kame ana fokolisa etingana tawo no kwapumena okwaulwisa okumona eliseli no liywi no kuwaba no kanya ya Kelisite woyo oli mu sifekiso sa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5"/>Kakuli eyo tukutaza kayetu, kono Jesu Kelesite mukutenda Mbumu, naaci aba tuli abika enu mulibaka lya Jesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6"/>Kakuli Nyambe yo naamba nji, “Mulesele eliseli litundise ouwi!” woyo ona monisa mu micima yetu okutuba eliseli no zibo no kanya ya Nyambe mu lubala lwa Kelesite.<verse eid="2CO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7"/>Kono kame tuli ni ufumu mu tucoo no limaa no litunga, okumonisa nji amaata kame ali kwa Nyambe mi kasa kwaaci. <verse eid="2CO 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8"/>Kame tuyanda mu mukwa onje, kono katu honehe, kame tuna ziyelehe, kono katu bwelwe esepo, <verse eid="2CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9"/>kame tu yandisiwa, kono ka tu fulalelwa, kame tu kwisetwa banji, kono katusinyehe. <verse eid="2CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10"/>Enako yonje kame tushimbile elifu lya Jesu mu tinyutu tetu, nji cwale omoyo wa Jesu omonahale mu tinyutu tetu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11"/>Kakuli aci me tuyoya, kame tu twaliwa ku lifu mulibaka lya Jesu, nji cwale omoyo wa Jesu omonahale mu lutu lwetu olo lufa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12"/>Cwale elifu kame lisebeza mwaaci, kono omoyo kame osebeza mwaanyi.<verse eid="2CO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13"/>Kakuli kame tuli ni mebo imweya no tumelo kanyi woyo onaku n̄ola nji, “Kame nina pumene, mi cwale kame ni naamba.” naaci natu pumene ngeso mi cwale kame twamba. <verse eid="2CO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14"/>Kame tuyii nji woyo ona kwingula Ombumu Jesu kwaafu mba twingula ngeeso naaci kwaafu bamweya ni Jesu nikutulita naanyi balubala lwaye. <verse eid="2CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15"/>Kakuli einu yonje kame itendiwa mulibaka lyenu nji cwale esishemo sekeze mukupula kwaanu no kupula nji ifanene okwekeza oukutumela ku kanya ya Nyambe.<verse eid="2CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyoya mulibaka no Tumelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16"/>Cwale tulese okuzwafa. Ounu wetu na kundee kame usinyeha, kono ounu wetu namukaci kame ushemunwa ba liywaa ni liywaa. <verse eid="2CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17"/>Kakuli amayando etu no kucaniba kame atulukiseta kuneneba no kanya no kwaabwa no kwafaniketwa konje. <verse eid="2CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18"/>Kakuli ka twaliketa kwiinu eyo imonahala, kono kwiinu no kwa monahala, kakuli einu eyo imonahala niya mu nako icana feela, kono einu no kwa monahala niya kuta oko no kwaabwa.<verse eid="2CO 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Omundi Wetu naku Wilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1"/>Kakuli kame tulimukile nji cwale etende naba litunga bano eyo tuyoyamo kame isinyeha, mi kame tuli ni muyako kwa Nyambe, endoo no kwa tendiwa ni maoko, no kwaabwa mu wilu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2"/>Niti luli bano kame tu tonga ni ku lakaza, nji Nyambe atufuke ni lutu olo salukufeke kanyi endoo yetu na ku wilu, <verse eid="2CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3"/>nji cwale aba tukufukayo tulese okuwaniwa nji kame tuli njeshe. <verse eid="2CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4"/>Kakuli aci aba tusili mu tende eyi, kame tutonga ni kwimelwa kasa nji mbatwikala nokwakufuka, kono kame tu singa okufuka, nji cwale eso sifa si miniwe ku moyo. <verse eid="2CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5"/>Woyo ona tulukisete einu yonje eyi ni Nyambe, yonyene ona tubi Emebo kanyi oukulemenenena feela.<verse eid="2CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6"/>Cwale enako yonje kame tuli ni undume no kuwaba. Kame tuyii nji abo tusili ku mundi mu lutu kame tuli oku no kuleba ni Mbumu. <verse eid="2CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7"/>Kakuli kame twenda ni tumelo, kasa mu kumona. <verse eid="2CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8"/>Kame tuli ni undume no kuwaba mi kame tutwesa okusiya okutunda mu lutu ni kwikala ku mundi ni Mbumu. <verse eid="2CO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9"/>Simba nji kame tuli ku mundi simba katusako kame tutenda omuhupulo wetu nji tumuwabelise. <verse eid="2CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10"/>Kakuli kame tufanene okwiiya tonje balubala no sipula no katulo sa Kilesite, nji cwale omunu ni munu atambule eso no kuwaba simba esi no kwiiba okukumanena kweyo anatende mu lutu.<verse eid="2CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oulikani ni Nyambe mwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11"/>Kakuli kame tulimuka okucila Ombumu, tu susuweze aanu. Kono eso tuli kwa sonyene kame silimukiwa kwa Nyambe mi kame ni sepa nji kame silimukiwa ngeso ni kulizwalo lyenu. <verse eid="2CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12"/>Kasa nji kame tu kubeeka kwaanyi kame, kono kame tumiba elibaka nji mukukumuse mulibaka lyetu, nji cwale mutwese okutambula awo akukumuseta mu sibaka no munu mi kasa mu mucima waye. <verse eid="2CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13"/>Kakuli nji katunahana wino twenyene, nimulibaka lya Nyambe, nji kame tuli mu mihupulo yetu no kuluka nimulibaka lyenu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14"/>Kakuli elilato lya Kilesite kame litusiulula kakuli natuku kolwisisa nji omunu mumweya nafele aanu no kupula, cwalehe aanu onje kame anafu. <verse eid="2CO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15"/>Mi kame ana fele aanu onje nji awo ayoya alese oukuyoyela onyene kono ni mulibaka lyaye woyo onakufa mulibaka lyoo mi na kwingulwa kwaafu.<verse eid="2CO 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16"/>Okutunda bano ni kuta kuuso, cwalehe, tulese okwaliketa omunu mu mukwa no unu, kanyi omo tuna kwalitela Kilesite mu mukwa no unu, omo tuna kumwaliketela tulese okutenda ngeso. <verse eid="2CO 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17"/>Cwalehe nji omunu kame ali mwa Kilesite, kame ali esumbiwa no ubya, esi no kale nasibu, komumone, eyi no ubya naiyi. <verse eid="2CO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18"/>Eyi yonje kame itunda kwa Nyambe woyo mwa Kilesite natu usu kwa yonyene ni kutuba omusebezi no kuusana. <verse eid="2CO 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19"/>Kame ku talusa nji mwa Kilesite, Nyambe nakuusa elitunga kwa yonyene kasa okwa balela emibonda yoo mi nabeeke mwaaci eliywi no kukuusa.<verse eid="2CO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20"/>Cwale kame tuli aimaneni a Kilesite, Nyambe kame anabeeke eliywi lyaye mwaaci. Kame tumyambela mu sibaka sa Kilesite nji muusetwe kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21"/>Kakuli mulibaka lyetu Nyambe nakutenda Kilesite esibi woyo ona kuulwa okulimuka esibi, nji cwale mwa yonyene tutendiwe ano kuluka a Nyambe.<verse eid="2CO 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1"/>Okusebeza bamweya ni Nyambe, kame tu mi kumbela nji mu lese oku tambula esishemo sa Nyambe mukwa tusa esinjili. <verse eid="2CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2"/>Kakuli kame anaamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Ba nako ifanena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">Kame nina kuteeteta kwaanyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">Kame nina kumi tusa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">ba liywaa no kuyoyisiwa.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Komumone, cwale enako naikwana, mumone cwale sebeli eliywaa no kuyoyisiwa. <verse eid="2CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3"/>Ka tubekela omunu esi sitataliso mu mundila yaye nji cwale tulese okuwaniwa ni mubonda mu musebezi wetu. <verse eid="2CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4"/>Kono kame tuli abika a Nyambe tukubeeke twenyene mundila yonje mu koongola onene, mu mayando, mu kuulwa mane ni mu tinako no kubambaba, <verse eid="2CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5"/>mu kufuliwa, mu titolongo, mu mifilifili, mu misebezi, mu kutona, nimu lishebo, <verse eid="2CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6"/>mu kukena, mu zibo, ni kutatelela, ni musa ni Mebo No Kukena, mu lilato no niti. <verse eid="2CO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7"/>mu kwamba eniti, ni maata a Nyambe ni ilwiso no kuluka mu lyoko no silyo neli no simoo. <verse eid="2CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8"/>Mu kukutekiwa ni mukwakutekiwa, mu kwambiwa ouyi ni uwa. Kame tutendiwa kanyi aongi mi cwale kame twamba eyi no niti, <verse eid="2CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9"/>kanyi katu limukiwa mi cwale kame tulimukiwa wino, kanyi kame tufile mi komumone kame tuyoya, kanyi kame tuna kubiwa ekoto kono katu sikwibaiwa, <verse eid="2CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10"/>kanyi kame twenine kono enako yonje kame tuwabelelwa, kanyi kame tushebile kono kame tufumisa ano kupula, kanyi katukwite einu kandi kame tuluwile einu yonje.<verse eid="2CO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11"/>Akanwa ketu kame tu myambela patalaza, Amakolinte, omucima wetu nau yatuluka. <verse eid="2CO 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12"/>Ka muukele munyima mulibaka lyetu, kono kame muukela munyima mulibaka no mayando enu. <verse eid="2CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13"/>Mu kuusa kame naamba kanyi kame nambela anukana, muyatulule emicima yenu ngeso.<verse eid="2CO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emamela kweyi no Kutenda ouyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14"/>Mu lese okusebeleza bamweya nawo no kwapumena, kakuli oukuwana kubine kuli kwano kuluka na sikutenda ouyi? Simba oulikani no liseli ni uwi? <verse eid="2CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15"/>Kilesite kaumweya ali nawo ni Satani? Simba ngasibine osiku pumena nji akuyupe nawo no kwapumena? <verse eid="2CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16"/>Ibine etumelelano ili ku ndoo ya Nyambe ni ifekiso no kulapela? Kakuli kame tuli Endoo ya Nyambe no kuyoya! Kanyi Nyambe aba anamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Kame sa niyoye mwa onyene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">ni kwenda mukaci koo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">mi kame sa nitende Nyambe woo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">onyene atende aanu ange.<verse eid="2CO 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17"/>Cwalehe mutunde kwa onyene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">mi mukutabe noo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">kame kwamba Ombumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Mu lese okulema esi no kwakena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">mi mba nimi tambula.<verse eid="2CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18"/>Kame sani tende sitenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">mi anyi mu tende anange no andumbana naa no akatana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">kame kwamba Ombumu no maata onje.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1"/>Abaange cwale kakuli kame tuli ni tisepiso eti, tu kukenise ku oukusilafaza konje no lutu noku no mebo, mane tutende ano kukena awo kupetahalile mu kucila Nyambe.<verse eid="2CO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuwabelelwa kwa Paulusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2"/>Mu tuyatulwele emicima yenu. Kakwisa omunu tuna foseze, ka tu silyanganisa omunu, kakwisa woyo tuna kwangwisa. <verse eid="2CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3"/>Ka naamba eyi nji niminyaze, kakuli kame nina kwamba oweli nji kame muli mu micima yetu, okufa ni kuyoya bamweya. <verse eid="2CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4"/>Kame ni kwite etumelo inene mwaanyi, kame ni kuyeema onene mwanyi! Kame niiyalile okombaombiwa, kame ni wabelelwe onene mu mayando etu onje.<verse eid="2CO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5"/>Kakuli simba aba tuna kwiiya mu Masedoniya, Etinyutu tetu katisi kupumula kono kame tuna kuyanda ku maneku onje okulwa kundee mi mukaci kame tucila. <verse eid="2CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6"/>Kono Nyambe woyo ombaomba emicima yawo aku kokobeza, naku tombaomba mu kwiiya kwa Tite. <verse eid="2CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7"/>Mi kasa mu kwiiya kwaye fela, kono kame ni kweyo ana kumyombaombisa kanyi aba ana otwambele eyi no kulakaza kwenu, ni ku lila kwenu, mane ninyolelo yenu kwa mene nji cwale okuwabelelwa kwange kusiliko onene.<verse eid="2CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8"/>Kakuli naba nina kumyenisa ni lin̄olo lyange, ka niku nyaza, Kame nina kuku nyaza aba nina kumona nji elin̄olo elyo kame lina ku myenisa, naba ku nakutenda mu nako icana fela. <verse eid="2CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9"/>Kanyi omo kwikalele kame ni wabelelwa, kasa mulibaka nji kame muna kweena onene, kono kakuli kame muna kweena mulibaka no kubaka, kakuli okweena kwa nyambe no litunga ninji cwale mulese okuyanda esinjili mwaaci. <verse eid="2CO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10"/>Kakuli okweena kwa Nyambe kame kulita okubaka oko kutwala ku kuyoyisiwa mi kakwisa oukunyaza, kono okweena no litunga kame kulita elifu. <verse eid="2CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11"/>Komumone eso anatende Nyambe mwaanyi mulibaka no kweena kwenu, ka kutukufalelwa no ngaibi omo musingela oukukenisa mwenyene, oukukataza kwenu, ni oku tambwela kwa ngaibi, ni takazo no ngaibi, ni kulukisa no ngaibi, kakoto no ngaibi! Kweyo yonje kame muna tumonisa nji ka mu siikalamo mu taba eyo.<verse eid="2CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12"/>Cwale simba nji kame nina ku mi n̄olela ngeso elin̄olo, kasa mulibaka lya woyo ona kufosa, simba mulibaka lya woyo ona ku fosezwa. Kono neli nji ku monahale kwanyi enyolelo yenu mulibaka lyetu balubala lwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13"/>Cwalehe natu ombaombiwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Simba nji natuku ombaombiwa, kame tuna kuwabelelwa onene mulibaka lya Tite ona kuwabelelwa kakuli eminahano yaye kame ina kukatuluha mulibaka lyenu monje. <verse eid="2CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14"/>Kakuli naba nina ku kuyeema kwa yonyene mulibaka lyenu, kanisi kwenisiwa. Kono kanyi einu yonje tuna kwamba kwanyi neli ya niti, cwalehe oukuyeema kwetu balubala lwa Tite naku monisa eniti. <verse eid="2CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15"/>Elilato lya Tite kwaanyi lisi ekezeha, aba apuluka oukukuteka kwenu monje ni kucila ni kunjanjata muna kumu tambwelamo. <verse eid="2CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16"/>Kame niwabelelwa kakuli kame nili ni tumelo no kupetahala mwaanyi.<verse eid="2CO 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Okuba no Asikupumena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1"/>Abange, kame tusinga nji mulimuke esishemo sa Nyambe eso sina monisiwa mu tikeleke namu Mesodoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2"/>Kakuli mu kwetekiwa onene no mayando, okuwabelelwa koo no kupula ni kusheba koo kame ana tundisa oufumu mu kuba koo. <verse eid="2CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3"/>Kakuli kame anabi okukumanena nomo ana kutweseta, kanyi aba nitwesa okupaka mane ni kubitelela omo ana kutweseta mu kusinga koo, <verse eid="2CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4"/>kame ana tukumbele mu ku tundamena onene nji twa lumelele okwingena mu tuso eyi itendelwa aanu a Nyambe no kukena. <verse eid="2CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5"/>Kame ana tende okubita esi tuna kusepa, kakuli kame ana tangisa oweli oukubeeka kunji wa Mbumu ni kunji wetu mu kusinga kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6"/>Kame tuna kumbela Tite woyo ona kutateka omusebezi oweli, nji afanene oku umanenena ngeso mukaci kenu owo musebezi no sishemo. <verse eid="2CO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7"/>Cwale kanyi aba muna pulelwe mu inu yonje, mu tumelo, mu kwamba, mu zibo, mu niti yonje mane ni mu lilato lyenu mulibaka lyetu, mu mone nji mupulelwe ni mu musebezi no utokwa.<verse eid="2CO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8"/>Ka naamba eyi kanyi etaelo. Kono mukulimuka mulibaka no niti no yenu nji elilato lyenu no niti ngeso. <verse eid="2CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9"/>Kakuli kame muyii esishemo sa Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite nji naaba ana kufuma, cwale mulibaka lyenu natende osikusheba nji cwale mukusheba kwaye mufanene okufuma.<verse eid="2CO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10"/>Cwale mu taba eyi kame niba ekelezo yange nji kwa kuwaba aanyi cwale okumanenena eyo munaku tateka mwakuyu kasa mu kutenda fela kono muku lakaza, <verse eid="2CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11"/>cwale nji okutukiseta kwenu mu kulakza kufanene okwendelela ni kumanenena kwenu kweyo mu kwite. <verse eid="2CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12"/>Kakuli nji okutukiseta kwakuli kame kulumelelwe okukumanena kweso akwite omunu, kasa okukumanena kweso aulwile omunu.<verse eid="2CO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13"/>Kani talusa nji anjili atusiwe mi anyi muimelwe, <verse eid="2CO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14"/>kono ku tendwe mu kufanenena eyo mukwite ba nako ino mufanene okwekeza eyo asinga, nji cwale eyo akwite yekeze eyo musinga nji cwale kufanenene. <verse eid="2CO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15"/>Kanyi omo kun̄olelwe nji, “Woyo ona ungeke onene kasi siyalelwa esinjili mi woyo ona ungeke mbicani alese okuulwa.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tite ni Sikwata saye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16"/>Kono kame tukutumela kwa Nyambe woyo ona beeke epabalelo inene mulibaka lyenu mu mucima wa Tite. <verse eid="2CO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17"/>Kakuli katambula fela oku kumbela kwetu, kono mu koongola kwaye onene kame ata ni kwaanyi mu kusinga kwaye. <verse eid="2CO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18"/>Bamweya ni yonyene kame tu tuma omwabetu, woyo olimukiwa onene elibubo lyaye mu tikeleke tonje muku kutaza eliywi no kuwaba. <verse eid="2CO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19"/>Mane kasa eyo fela, kono naku ketiwa ku tikeleke nji aende naaci mu musebezi waye no sishemo owo tu shimbile mulibaka no kanya ya Mbumu ni kumonisa okusinga kwetu no kuwaba.<verse eid="2CO 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20"/>Tu tende ngeso nji kuulwe omunu woyo sotunyaza mulibaka no tuso no mpo eyi, eyo twendisa. <verse eid="2CO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21"/>Kakuli kame tusinga okutenda wino, kasa mu miyo a Mbumu fela, kono ni mu miyo no aanu ngeso. <verse eid="2CO 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22"/>Natu tumu omwabetu bamweya nonyene woyo tuna eteke aka no kupula ni kuwana eniti yaye mu titaba no kupula. Kono kame alakaza onene bano ni kubitelela mulibaka noku misepa onene. <verse eid="2CO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23"/>Kakuli Tite kame atendile omulikani wange mane niku sebeza naye mu misebezi yenu, mi kwaabetu kame ali atumiwa no tikeleke ekanya ya Kilesite. <verse eid="2CO 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24"/>Cwale mu monise balubala no tikeleke oupaki no lilato lyenu mane ni ukuyeema kwetu mulibaka lyenu kwaanu aa.<verse eid="2CO 8:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Etuso kwaabetu Alumeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1"/>Cwale kasikwite outokwa nji kame mene ni min̄olele mulibaka no nubu no aanu a Nyambe, <verse eid="2CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2"/>kakuli kame niyii okutukiseta kwenu, oko nikuyeema mulibaka lyenu kwaanu no Mesodoniya okwamba nji, “Akaya kame ano kutukiseta kale mwakuyu.” Mane oku tukufalelwa kwenu kame kuna susuweze ano kupula. <verse eid="2CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3"/>Cwale kame nituma abaange, nji cwale okuyeema kwetu mulibaka lyenu kulese okutenda oko nambulwa tuso mu taba eyi, nji cwale mufanene okutukiseta kanyi omo ninambele kame mufanene okutenda ngeso. <verse eid="2CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4"/>Anjili mwendi ano Masodoniya kame saiye ni mene mi cwale aba samiwane nji kamwasi kutukiseta kale, kame satwenisiwe, kono anyi mbamwenisiwa onene, mulibaka noku misepa. <verse eid="2CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5"/>Cwale kame ninahana nji kwakuwaba oku kumbela abetu okuta kwaanyi balubala lwange nji akalukise oweli mulibaka no mpo eyo muna kusepisa nji cwale ifanene okulukisiwa kasa okukandimekwa kono itendiwe mu kusinga.<verse eid="2CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6"/>Etaba neyi, woyo okuna muku caniba kame sayangule muku caniba mi woyo okuna onene kame sayangule onene. <verse eid="2CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7"/>Munu ni munu atende omo ana nahanele mu mucima waye, kasa mu kubilaela simba okukandimekwa kakuli Nyambe kame asinga woyo oba yo wabelelwe. <verse eid="2CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8"/>Mi Nyambe kame atwesa okumiba embuyoti yonje mu kupula nji cwale enako yonje mufanene okwikala ni inu no kupula mane kame atwesa okumiba mu kupula mulibaka no musebezi onje no kuwaba. <verse eid="2CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9"/>Kanyi omo kun̄olelwe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Kame ana kwaa mukupula, kame anabi asikusheba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">okuluka kwaye kwikala enako yonje okuta okuno kwaabwa.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10"/>Woyo oba omukuni embuto ni sinkwa okutenda esilya mbabi onene ni kubitelela eyo mukwite mane aekeze ekutulo no kuluka kwenu. <verse eid="2CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11"/>Kame sa mu fumisiwe mu mikwa yonje no kuba onene eyo okubitela mwaaci mbaitundisa enubu no okutumela kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12"/>Kakuli okwendisa ekoleko eyo kasa nji fela oku tusa aanu a Nyambe awo aulwile eyo asaela, kono ngeso ni kwekeza mu tinubu no kupula no oukutumela kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13"/>Munji no kweteka omusebezi ou, kame samuyeme Nyambe nukubeeka kwenu mu kulimuka eliywi no kuwaba lya Kilesite mane ni sishemo senu no kuba kwa onyene ni kwanjili onje. <verse eid="2CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14"/>Cwale muku minyolelwa ni kumilapelela mulibaka no sishemo no kupula sa Nyambe sili mwaanyi. <verse eid="2CO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15"/>Kulumbiwe Nyambe mulibaka no mpo yaye no kwatwesiwa okutalusiwa.<verse eid="2CO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yo Sileleza Esitulo saye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1"/>Time Paulusi, kame ni mikumbela ni musa ni mucima no kuwaba wa Kilesite mene woyo no kukokobeza aba niku mona olubala ni lubala naanyi, kono kame nibambabile aba nili oku no kuleba. <verse eid="2CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2"/>Kame ni mikumbela nji aba sani ikaleko kwaanyi nilese okumonisa okubambaba awo ali ni tumelo kanyi omo sani monisete okubambaba kwanjili awo atuyambuteta nji kame tutenda einu no litunga. <verse eid="2CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3"/>Kakuli naba tuyoya mu litunga katulwi endwaa kanyi omo atendela asi litunga. <verse eid="2CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4"/>Kakuli eilwiso no ndwaa yetu kasa ya litunga kono kame ili ni maata no kusinya amakwakwa aongolile, <verse eid="2CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5"/>kame tusinya etin̄ananyi neyo no kukumusa ikwangwisa aanu okulimuka Nyambe, mi kame tununga emihupulo yonje nji ikuteke Kilesite. <verse eid="2CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6"/>Munyima no kupumena okupetahala kwenu, mi mbatukutukisete okuba ekoto ku kezo no mbulwa okupumena nji okupumena kwenu na kupetahala.<verse eid="2CO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7"/>Mwalikete kweyo ili balubala no miyo enu. Nji omunu kame akolwa nji ni wa Kilesite alemuhe yonyene nji kanyi aba ali wa Kilesite naaci kame tuli aye ngeso. <verse eid="2CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8"/>Kakuli naaba sani kuyeeme kanyonyo mulibaka no maata etu awo tubilwe kwa Mbumu ano ku miyaka, kasa ano kumi sinya, kani tamba okweena. <verse eid="2CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9"/>Kani singi okutenda kanyi kame nimi cilisa ni man̄olo ange. <verse eid="2CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10"/>Kakuli kame aamba nji, “Aman̄olo aye ni akulema ni maata, kono olutu lwaye no unu olo luliko kame lufokola, mi okwamba kwaye kakukwite etaluso!” <verse eid="2CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11"/>Mulesele aanu no ngeso ayupisise nji eso twamba ni man̄olo aba tuli kundina, kame tusitenda naaba tuliko.<verse eid="2CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12"/>Aci kame tu cila ouku bala simba oukufaniketa twenyene nanjili awo akukulisa onyene. Kono aba akubeeka ba sikala omunjili ku munjili, mane nukubapanya onyene ku munjili ni munjili, kayupisisa. <verse eid="2CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13"/>Cwale aci katu tamba oukuyeema okumatuka esikala, kono kame satute ba sikala eso ana tutabele Nyambe, okukeela simba baanyi. <verse eid="2CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14"/>Kakuli katukukulisa twenyene, simba nji katukeela ba siyemo senu, kono aaci ano matatekelo okulita eliywi no kuwaba lya Kileste kwaanyi. <verse eid="2CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15"/>Katu kuyeeme okubitelela esikala mu musebezi no akwetu, kono esepo yetu ninji kanyi etumelo yenu aba yekeza, elitema lyetu mukaci kenu mwendi mba lineneba onene, <verse eid="2CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16"/>nji cwale tuka kutaze eliywi no kuwaba mu tinaha tinjili okusiya omo muli, metu ulwile oukuyeema ku musebezi owo ona tendiwa oweli mu litema no munjili.<verse eid="2CO 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17"/>“Cwale mulese woyo okuyema, akuyeme mulibaka lya Mbumu.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18"/>Kakuli kasa nji munu woyo okukulisa yonyene nji natambulwa, kono omunu woyo okulisiwa kwa Mbumu.<verse eid="2CO 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11"/>
  <para style="s">Paulusi ni Atumiwa no Mapwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1"/>Kambe kame samuni pumenene kanyonyo mu weelo wange. Mulumele ngeso! <verse eid="2CO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2"/>Kakuli kame ni mifela omuna no ulumeli, kakuli kame nimiba kwa Kilesite kanyi omukwaliwa no niti kwa mbumwaye mumweya. <verse eid="2CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3"/>Kono kame nicila nji kanyi nyoka aba ina koonga Eba ku mapwa ayo no kwiiba, emihupulo yenu kame saite kundina okutunda mu niti ni tukufalo no kukena kwa Kilesite. <verse eid="2CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4"/>Kakuli omunu nji kame aiya muku mikutaza Jesu mundina okubita woyo tuna mikutaza, simba nji kame mu tambula emebo indina okutunda kweyo muna tambula, simba nji kame mupumena eliywi no kuwaba lindina okutunda kwelyo muna pumene kame mukubeeka kwa yonyene luli.<verse eid="2CO 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5"/>Kame ni nahana nji kanili munyonyo kwatumiwa no kuneneba ni kubitelela. <verse eid="2CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6"/>Simba nji kani sikwiyeta wino mu kwamba, kani kwite ezibo, mu ndila yonje natutende omuhupulo ou mwaanyi mu inu yonje.<verse eid="2CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7"/>Kana kame ninatende esibi aba nina kukukokobeza, nji cwale anyi mu kulisiwe, kakuli kame nina kutaza eliywi no kuwaba lya Nyambe okuulwile eso munanibi? <verse eid="2CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8"/>Kame nina itele etikeleke tinjili okutambula etuso okutunda kwa onyene mulibaka no kumi sebeleza. <verse eid="2CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9"/>Mi naba nina kwikala naanyi ni kuulwa einu, kanisi kwimezwa omunu, kakuli eyo nina kusaela kame ina kutunda kwabaange ana kutunda mu Mesodoniya. Cwale kame nina lesele oku miimezwa mane nisilesele okumi imezwa mu mukwa onje. <verse eid="2CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10"/>Mi kanyi eniti ya Kilesite aba ili mwa mene, oukuyeema kwange oko kakutamba okondoka mu ilalanda yonje namu Akaya. <verse eid="2CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11"/>Iikene nambela esi? Kakuli kani misingi? Nyambe yo limukile nji kame nimisinga!<verse eid="2CO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12"/>Mi eso nitenda kame sani twalelele okusitenda mulibaka no kukwangwisa awo asinga okuwana elibaka nji mu musebezi no kuyeema koo kame asebeza ba sinu sikufekile kanyi eso tutenda naaci. <verse eid="2CO 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13"/>Aanu no ngeso kame atendile atumiwa no mapwa, kame asebeza ni tingana no kwiiba, kame akutenda onyene kanyi atumiwa a Kilesite. <verse eid="2CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14"/>Ka kukomokisa, kakuli simba Satani kame ana kukutenda yonyene kanyi elingeloi no liseli! <verse eid="2CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15"/>Cwale kaku komokisa nji abika aye nonyene ngeso kame akutenda kanyi abika no kuluka. Amamaneneno oo kame sakufeke ni misebezi yoo.<verse eid="2CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amayando a Paulusi yoli Omutumiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16"/>Kame niukela kame nji omunu alese oku nahana nji nili mweelo. Kono simba nji kame munahana ngeso, muni tambule kanyi mweelo, nji cwale ni kuyeeme kanyonyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17"/>Eyi naamba kani yaamba ni maata a Mbumu kono kanyi mweelo mu ukuyeema ni sepile. <verse eid="2CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18"/>Abakulingeso ano kupula kame akuyeema mu inu no litunga, ni mene kame sa ni kuyeeme ngeso. <verse eid="2CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19"/>Kakuli kame muwabelelwa naelo, anyi mwenyene me mutendile ano kushangama. <verse eid="2CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20"/>Kakuli kame mupumena nji omunu amitende abika aye, simba okumiputelela, simba oku mibyangula eyenu, simba okwikala beulu yenu, simba okumiyaa mu lubala. <verse eid="2CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21"/>Mu kweena kwange kame naamba nji natuku fokola onene kweeyo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Kono eso sonje atenda omunu okuyeema naso, kame naamba kanyi omweelo ni mene kame nitwesa okuyeema ngeso. <verse eid="2CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22"/>Okame Amahebelu? Cwale nimene kame nili ngeso. Okame Amaisilaele? Ni mene ngeso. Kalokame olusika lwa Abulahama? Ni mene ngeso. <verse eid="2CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23"/>Ninji okame abika a Kilesite? Kame nili wino, Kame naamba kanyi sipulumuki ni ku sebeza onene ni kwikala mu tolongo onene ni kufuliwa no kwabalwa mane ni kwikala abeebi ni lifu. <verse eid="2CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24"/>Mu tinako titanu kame nina kutambulanga ku maoko no aendisi no Majuda etinupa no kakwana makumi anee okutundisiko olupa lumweya (39). <verse eid="2CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25"/>Kame ni na shapiwa kaatu ni lunupa, kame nina kondiwa ni mawee kamweya, kame ni na kufelwa ku sisepa kaatu, kame nina koonda eliywaa limweya ni usiku umweya mu liwate. <verse eid="2CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26"/>Mu misipili no kupula kame nina kwiyelwa etikozi mu misindi, etikozi kwa mbuyi, etikozi kwaanu ange, etikozi kwa simacaba, etikozi mu mulenen̄i, etikozi mu mahalaupa, etikozi mu liwate, ekozi kwa baange no mapwa, <verse eid="2CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27"/>mu kusebeza onene ni utata, mu kwalangana wino aka no kupula ousiku, mu lishebo ni linyotwa, mu kuulwa eilya no kupula, mu kufa esenge ni mu kuulwa eikumango. <verse eid="2CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28"/>Cwale okutundisako einu injili, kame kuli outata kwa mene oniyela mu liywaa ni liywaa no kutukufalelwa etikeleke tonje. <verse eid="2CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29"/>Anyini no kufokola, mi mene si fokola, anyine sokwisetwa mu sibi mi mene sitini?<verse eid="2CO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30"/>Nji kame nikuyeema, kame sani kuyeeme ku inu eyo imonisa oufokoli wange. <verse eid="2CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31"/>Nyambe ni Sitaye Mbumu Jesu, woyo ofuyolilwe mu nako yonje kame alimuka nji kanoongo. <verse eid="2CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32"/>Ku Damaseka, omubusisi no Mbumu Aletasi kame ana kutatelela omulenen̄i no Damaseka nji aninunge. <verse eid="2CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33"/>Kono kame nina kubeekiwa mu litanda okushulumukisetwa mu lihaulo ba limota mane sebeli ni banduka mu maoko aye.<verse eid="2CO 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Epono ya Paulusi ni Inulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1"/>Kame nifanena okuyeema, kakwisa eso ni wanabo kono cwale kame sa nilite neyi nina mono, neyi nina shotwelwe ya Mbumu. <verse eid="2CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2"/>Kame ni yii omunu mwa Kilesite woyo sebeli emyaka likumi ni tunee inabu ona ku shimbelwa ku liwilu no waatu, kuune nji mu lutu nji kundee no lutu kaniyii kono Nyambe yo limukile. <verse eid="2CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3"/>Cwale kame niyii nji omunu woyo kame ana kushimbelwa mu Paladaisi nji neli mu lutu simba mukuulwa olutu kaniyii kono Nyambe yo limukile. <verse eid="2CO 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4"/>Mi na kuyupa einu eyo nokwa twesiwa okwambeliwa, eyo no kwatwesiwa omunu okwamba. <verse eid="2CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5"/>Mu kwimanena woyo munu mbani kuyeeme kono muukwimanena menyene kanitamba okuyeema konji mu mifokolo yange. <verse eid="2CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6"/>Simba nji kame nisinga okuyeema, si tamba okutenda omweelo, kono kame sanambe mu niti. Kono kame sanitundemo nji cwale kuulwe omunu woyo sonahana onene eyange okubita eyo ana mono mwa mene simba eyo ana yupu kwa mene.<verse eid="2CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7"/>Mi okuni tundisa ku ukuyeema onene mulibaka no kupulelwa kweyi nina shotwelwe, omunguya nauku biwa mene mu lutu, omutumiwa wa Satani okuni fula okuni kanisa nji nilese oukuyeema. <verse eid="2CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8"/>Kame nina lapele Ombumu twaatu mulibaka no taba eyi nji itwese okuni siya. <verse eid="2CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9"/>Kono Ombumu sebeli wamba kwa mene nji, “Esishemo sange kame siku likana kakuli amaata ange kame apetahalile mu mifokolo.” Kame sani wabelelwe onene oukuyeema mu mifokolo yange, nji amaata a Kilesite apumulele beula yange. <verse eid="2CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10"/>Kakuli mulibaka lya Kilesite cwale kame ni wabelelwa mu mifokolo, mutingangu, mu matata, mu mayando ni mu kubambaba kakuli aba ni fokola cwale kame nongola.<verse eid="2CO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epilelo ya Paulusi ku Makolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11"/>Kame nina kutende kanyi omweelo, kame muna kuni kandimeka okwitenda, kakuli kame nina kufanena okukulisiwa kwaanyi. Kakuli kani bitiwa ku inu yonje kwaa atumiwa no kuneneba simba nji kakwisa omo niikalele. <verse eid="2CO 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12"/>Eisupo no mutumiwa no niti kame tina kumonisiwa mukaci kenu mu mucima onje no kuwaba ni isupo ni timakazo ni misebezi no maata. <verse eid="2CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13"/>Kana mu iikene omo muna kuulwa okusingiwa okubita etikeleke tinjili, konji eyo mene menyene kanisi miimezwa? Muni lemene omo nina foso!<verse eid="2CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14"/>Bano sebeli aka no waatu aka nikutukiseta okwiiya kwaanyi, mi kanitamba okumiimezwa kakuli kani saele eyenu, kono kame nisaela aanyi, kakuli kasa aana awo afanene oku babalela ashemi, kono ashemi okame awo ababalela aana. <verse eid="2CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15"/>Kame sani wabelelwe onene okutundisa ni kusebeleza emyoyo yenu. Nji kame nimi singa onene, mene kame nisingiwa kanyonyo?<verse eid="2CO 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16"/>Kono kame mupumena nji mene kanisi kumiimezwa, mbili wa kushangama omo mwambela, mi kame nina mileme mu kumyonga. <verse eid="2CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17"/>Ninji kame munakongiwa kwawo nina kutuma kwaanyi? <verse eid="2CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18"/>Kame nina kumbele Tite nji aka mi mone, mi kame nina tumu abange ni yonyene. Ninji Tite kame ana ku myonga? Katusiku tenda mu mebo imweya? Katusi kushimba endila imweya?<verse eid="2CO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19"/>Mwendi kame mu yambuta nji kame tuku sileleza twenyene kwaanyi? Kame twamba balubala lwa Nyambe mwa Kilesite, kakuli eyi tutenda yonje asingiwa, kame tuitenda nji mu yakiwe. <verse eid="2CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20"/>Kono kame nicila nji enako eyi sani iye kame sani miwane nji omu mwikalele kasa omo ni singela mi ni mene muni wane nji omu niikalele kasa omo mu singela. Mwendi kame sani wane omufilifili mwaanyi, nuuku fela omuna, ni kutina, nuukusinga mwenyene, ni kobana, nuukulwisa , nuuku kumusa, nukwakuyupa. <verse eid="2CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21"/>Kame nicila nji abasa niiye kwaanyi kame, Nyambe wange kame sani kokobeze balubala lwenu, mi kame sani lile mulibakalya ano kupula awo anatende esibi oweli, mi ka siibakela okukena, ouhule, ni titakazo no kwiiba ana tende.<verse eid="2CO 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Etitemuso ni Milaano no Mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1"/>Aka ni kawaatu aka niiya kwaanyi. “Ekatulo yonje kame ifanena okupakiwa kwaanu ayiili simba aatu.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2"/>Kame nina kuba emamela kwaanu awo ana kutenda esibi oweli nanjili onje, mi nisaaba emamela nibano naba niulwileko kanyi omo nina kutendela aba nina kupota aka no wiili nji cwale aba saniiye kame sitamba okwafela amakeke. <verse eid="2CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3"/>Kakuli kame musaela eniti nji Kilesite kame aamba mwa mene, kafokola muku tenda mwaanyi kakuli kame akwite amaata mwaanyi. <verse eid="2CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4"/>Kakuli kame ana kungongotelwa mu ku fokola, kono kame ayoya ni maata a Nyambe. Kakuli kame tufokola mwa yonyene, kono mukutenda naanyi kame tuyoya naye mu maata a Nyambe.<verse eid="2CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5"/>Mu kutatube mwenyene oku mona nji musongotite mu tumelo yenu. Mu kweteke mwenyene, kamu lemuha nji Jesu Kilesite kame ali mwaanyi? Konji mwendi luli aba samu kwangwe oukweteka. <verse eid="2CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6"/>Kame nisepa nji kame samuwane nji katusi kwangwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7"/>Kono kame tulapela Nyambe nji mulese oku tenda ouyi kasanji tu monahale nji natutwese etatubo kono mutende eso silukile naba tumonahala nji natu kwangwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8"/>Kakuli katu twese okutenda esinjili okulwisa eniti, kono konji ba niti fela. <verse eid="2CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9"/>Kakuli kame tu wabelelwa aba tu fokola mi anyi kame mongolile. Cwale eso tu lapela ninji mu tende ano kupetahala. <verse eid="2CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10"/>Kame ni n̄ola etitaba eti abo me sisako kwanyi, nji cwale aba saniiye nilese oukutusisa onene etukelo eyo ananibi Mbumu eyo no kumiyaka mi kasa eyo no kumishandola.<verse eid="2CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11"/>Abaange amamaneneno kame ni milaana, mulukise etindila tenu, muyupe eyi naamba, mukuyupe mukaci kenu, muyoye mu kozo mi Nyambe no lilato ni kozo mbaikala naanyi.<verse eid="2CO 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12"/>Muku keete omunjili ku munjili mu ukutubeta no kukena.<verse eid="2CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13"/>Aanu a Nyambe onje no kukena kame amikeeta. <verse eid="2CO 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14"/>Esishemo sa Mbumu Jesu Kilesite ni lilato lya Nyambe, nuumweya no Mebo No Kukena iikale naanyi moonje.<verse eid="2CO 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13"/>
</usx>
